msgid "F407 多 ADC 与注入采集"
msgstr "F407 multiple-ADC and injected acquisition"

msgid "本页描述 STM32F407VET6／ZGT6 的可选 `adc_group`，依据 RM0090 Rev22 的多 ADC、 注入序列和 DMA 模式，以及 DS8626 Rev12 的封装引脚。普通 ADC、PWM/ADC 和本接口 共用资源图；同一硬件域不会由两个接口同时操作。静态实例、只读方法表和 factory 的关系见 [factory 图](../explanation/factory.md)，请求借用见 [生命周期图](../assets/diagrams/request-lifecycle.svg)。"
msgstr "This page describes optional `adc_group` operation on STM32F407VET6/ZGT6, using the multiple-ADC, injected-sequence and DMA rules in RM0090 Rev22 and the package pads in DS8626 Rev12. Ordinary ADC, PWM/ADC and this interface share one resource graph; two interfaces never operate the same hardware domain simultaneously. See the [factory diagram](../explanation/factory.md) for static instances and readonly method tables, and the [lifecycle diagram](../assets/diagrams/request-lifecycle.svg) for request borrowing."

msgid "唯一责任者与装配"
msgstr "Unique owner and assembly"

msgid "`ADC123` 是一个逻辑 controller，独占 ADC1／2／3、公共 CCR、ADC IRQ，以及选中 模式需要的 timer 和 DMA2 stream0 channel0。双 ADC 或单 ADC 注入也独占这个公共域， 以防另一 owner 改变 MULTI、DMA 或分频。TIM2 留给 Core；不隐式接纳外部 EXTI、 动态 timer 或另一个 ADC controller。普通三个独立实例仍通过各自的 `adc` 接口 选择，它们不具有多 ADC 同步语义。"
msgstr "`ADC123` is one logical controller exclusively owning ADC1/2/3, the common CCR, ADC IRQ, and the selected timer and DMA2 stream0 channel0. Dual-ADC and single-ADC injected operation also own this common domain so another owner cannot change MULTI, DMA or the divider. TIM2 remains reserved for Core. External EXTI, a dynamic timer or another ADC controller is never implicitly adopted. Three ordinary independent instances continue to use their own `adc` interfaces and have no multiple-ADC synchronization semantics."

msgid "一份 TOML 选择操作、分辨率、采样序列、触发与有限排空预算。Host resolver 核验 精确 Board 授权、通道、相同物理 pad、DMA 和 IRQ 冲突，生成静态常量、实例、 强类型 factory 与薄 IRQ 连接。采样、寄存器时序、等待、停止和恢复全部由 C11 provider 执行。生成器没有硬件操作脚本或另一套运行时状态机。"
msgstr "One TOML input selects operation, resolution, sampling sequence, trigger and finite drain budget. The host resolver validates exact Board authorization, channels, identical physical pads, DMA and IRQ conflicts, then emits static constants, instances, strong factories and thin IRQ connections. The C11 provider implements acquisition, register ordering, waiting, stop and recovery. The generator contains neither hardware-operation scripts nor another runtime state machine."

msgid "Platform prepare 验证空闲的公共域与中断，取得并回读所需时钟，再重复检查原先可能 被门控的寄存器，最后配置授权输入为 analog／no-pull。它不启动转换。factory 查询不初始化硬件。Platform 记录引脚原值，完整关闭后才恢复；局部失败继续保留 相应资源，不能把无法读回的 gate 或 pad 当作已释放。"
msgstr "Platform prepare validates an idle common domain and interrupts, acquires and reads back clocks, rechecks registers that may previously have been gated, and configures authorized inputs as analog/no-pull. It does not start conversion. Factory lookup does not initialize hardware. Platform records original pad values and restores them only after complete close. Partial failures retain the affected resources; failed gate or pad readback never establishes release."

msgid "模式与内存格式"
msgstr "Modes and memory layout"

msgid "配置模式／operation"
msgstr "Configuration mode / operation"

msgid "转换与输出"
msgstr "Conversion and output"

msgid "`regular-sequence-dma`／`dual-simultaneous`"
msgstr "`regular-sequence-dma`／`dual-simultaneous`"

msgid "ADC1／2 同步，每组 1–16 ranks，CDR mode2，word DMA"
msgstr "ADC1/2 simultaneous, 1–16 ranks per sequence, CDR mode2 and word DMA"

msgid "`regular-sequence-dma`／`triple-simultaneous`"
msgstr "`regular-sequence-dma`／`triple-simultaneous`"

msgid "ADC1／2／3 同步，每组 1–16 ranks，CDR mode1，halfword DMA"
msgstr "ADC1/2/3 simultaneous, 1–16 ranks per sequence, CDR mode1 and halfword DMA"

msgid "`regular-sequence-dma`／`dual-interleaved`"
msgstr "`regular-sequence-dma`／`dual-interleaved`"

msgid "ADC1／2 交错，同一物理输入，每 frame 两个结果"
msgstr "ADC1/2 interleaved on one physical input, two results per frame"

msgid "`regular-sequence-dma`／`triple-interleaved`"
msgstr "`regular-sequence-dma`／`triple-interleaved`"

msgid "ADC1／2／3 交错，同一物理输入，每 frame 六个结果"
msgstr "ADC1/2/3 interleaved on one physical input, six results per frame"

msgid "`injected-sequence`／`single`"
msgstr "`injected-sequence`／`single`"

msgid "ADC1 单次注入，1–4 ranks，无 DMA"
msgstr "ADC1 single injected sequence, 1–4 ranks, no DMA"

msgid "`injected-sequence`／`dual`"
msgstr "`injected-sequence`／`dual`"

msgid "ADC1／2 同步单次注入，1–4 ranks，无 DMA"
msgstr "ADC1/2 simultaneous single injected sequence, 1–4 ranks, no DMA"

msgid "`injected-sequence`／`triple`"
msgstr "`injected-sequence`／`triple`"

msgid "ADC1／2／3 同步单次注入，1–4 ranks，无 DMA"
msgstr "ADC1/2/3 simultaneous single injected sequence, 1–4 ranks, no DMA"

msgid "`regular-blocks`／双／三 ADC 同步或交错"
msgstr "`regular-blocks` / dual or triple ADC, simultaneous or interleaved"

msgid "调用者预投递的完整 CDR block，DBM 循环，无隐藏 buffer"
msgstr "Caller-preposted complete CDR blocks, circular DBM, no hidden buffers"

msgid "`regular-software-injected-blocks`"
msgstr "`regular-software-injected-blocks`"

msgid "同步 regular blocks 与一个显式软件注入 request 共用 owner"
msgstr "Simultaneous regular blocks and one explicit software-injected request share one owner"

msgid "`regular-timer-injected-blocks`"
msgstr "`regular-timer-injected-blocks`"

msgid "同步 regular blocks 与独占 Table 69 timer 的单次注入共用 owner"
msgstr "Simultaneous regular blocks share one owner with a single injection from an exclusively owned Table 69 timer"

msgid "`regular-auto-injected`"
msgstr "`regular-auto-injected`"

msgid "一个 regular 序列后自动注入，两个结果 span 联合结清一次"
msgstr "Automatic injection follows one regular sequence; both result spans settle jointly once"

msgid "同步序列按 rank 排列，每个 rank 内依次 ADC1、ADC2、ADC3；同一 rank 的采样时间 相同。不同转换器不能在同一时刻采同一物理 pad；比较依据实际引脚，而非仅比较 channel 数字。ADC3 channel4 对应 PF6，与 ADC1 channel4 的 PA4 不同。交错模式 反而要求同一物理输入；三 ADC 只开放三个转换器确实共同拥有的输入。"
msgstr "Simultaneous sequences are rank-major, with ADC1, ADC2 and ADC3 ordered within each rank. Corresponding ranks use the same sampling time. Different converters cannot simultaneously sample one physical pad: admission compares actual pads rather than channel numbers alone. ADC3 channel4 is PF6, distinct from ADC1 channel4 on PA4. Interleaved operation instead requires one physical input; triple operation admits only inputs genuinely shared by all three converters."

msgid "交错的三 ADC frame 为 `1,2,3,1,2,3`，保持完整的三个 CDR 传输单位。12／10 位 采用 mode2，每样本两个字节、DMA 每次四字节；8／6 位采用 mode3，每样本一个字节、 DMA 每次两字节。同步模式和注入模式始终保留两个字节的原始整数。没有 CPU 搬运、 重排、补齐或隐藏采样缓冲。"
msgstr "A triple-interleaved frame is `1,2,3,1,2,3`, preserving all three CDR transfer units. At 12/10 bits, mode2 stores two bytes per sample with four-byte DMA accesses. At 8/6 bits, mode3 stores one byte per sample with two-byte DMA accesses. Simultaneous and injected modes always retain two-byte raw integers. There is no CPU copying, reordering, padding or hidden sample buffer."

msgid "通过 `info.format` 查询实际 storage、sample／scan stride、有效位数、组、触发和 顺序；`info.converters` 与 `channels` 是每个逻辑结果的静态身份。 `buffer_alignment` 表示真实 DMA 访问对齐，可能大于一个样本。raw request 的 `bytes` 必须精确等于 `frame_count * scan_stride`；NDTR 不超过 65535 个实际 DMA 访问。 显式 paired request 的 `bytes` 则是结果 descriptor 大小，两个数据 span 各按独立 layout 核验，不能把 descriptor 当作 DMA 数据。 DMA 目的地必须属于所选可写 SRAM 域，CCM 不可达。独立有限注入只接受一个完整 frame， 停止并排空后才按 JDR1–4 顺序写调用者缓冲；共用 owner 的注入见下节。"
msgstr "Query `info.format` for actual storage, sample/scan strides, significant bits, group, trigger and ordering. `info.converters` and `channels` identify each logical result. `buffer_alignment` describes actual DMA access alignment, which can exceed one sample. A raw request's `bytes` must equal `frame_count * scan_stride` exactly; NDTR cannot exceed 65535 actual DMA accesses. For an explicit paired request, `bytes` is the result-descriptor size. Each data span is checked against its own layout; the descriptor is not DMA payload. DMA destinations must belong to selected writable SRAM domains; CCM is unreachable. Standalone finite injected acquisition accepts only one complete frame and writes the caller buffer in JDR1–4 order after stop and drain. Injection under a shared owner is described below."

msgid "`resolution_bits` 可选 6／8／10／12；重复通道必须保持一致采样时间。模拟看门狗 显式选择原始码上下界，越界作为本次 IO 错误处理，不执行产品保护政策。减少位数 时，C provider 按硬件比较器规则移位阈值；它不改变数字输出的原始码含义。"
msgstr "`resolution_bits` selects 6/8/10/12. Repeated channels require consistent sampling times. Analog-watchdog limits are explicit raw codes; a violation becomes an IO error for the request and does not run product protection policy. At reduced resolution, the C provider shifts thresholds according to the hardware comparator rules without changing raw output-code semantics."

msgid "触发、时间与有限完成"
msgstr "Triggering, time and finite completion"

msgid "周期性同步 regular 由独占 timer 触发，timer period 必须严格大于所选序列的名义 转换预算。`regular-auto-injected` 只产生一个 one-pulse，`period_us` 表示首次边沿 延迟，不冒充周期性采样间隔；它可以短于序列转换时间。 可选 TIM1 CH1／2／3、TIM3 CH1／TRGO、TIM4 CH4、TIM5 CH1／2／3、 TIM8 CH1／TRGO。配置期计算真实 APB timer clock 和整除分频，不隐式改慢触发。"
msgstr "Periodic simultaneous regular acquisition uses an exclusive timer whose period must strictly exceed the selected sequence's nominal conversion budget. `regular-auto-injected` generates only one pulse: `period_us` is the delay to the first edge, not a periodic sampling interval, and may be shorter than the sequence conversion time. Sources are TIM1 CH1/2/3, TIM3 CH1/TRGO, TIM4 CH4, TIM5 CH1/2/3 and TIM8 CH1/TRGO. Configuration computes the actual APB timer clock and exact integer divider; it never silently slows the trigger."

msgid "注入支持软件启动，或 TIM1 CH4／TRGO、TIM3 CH2／4、TIM4 CH1／2／3／TRGO、 TIM5 CH4／TRGO、TIM8 CH2／3／4。硬件触发采用 one-pulse，避免第二次事件覆盖 JDR。 有限交错模式采用软件启动、有限 DMA 和显式 5–20 ADCCLK 间隔。交错输出不把名义 spacing 误报为完整 frame 时间；`physical_scan_halfcycles=0` 表示未提供该完整时长。"
msgstr "Injected acquisition supports software start or TIM1 CH4/TRGO, TIM3 CH2/4, TIM4 CH1/2/3/TRGO, TIM5 CH4/TRGO and TIM8 CH2/3/4. Hardware triggering uses one-pulse mode to prevent a second event overwriting JDR. Finite interleaved modes use software start, finite DMA and an explicit 5–20 ADCCLK delay. Nominal spacing is not reported as a complete frame duration; `physical_scan_halfcycles=0` means that full duration is unavailable."

msgid "调用发生在同一特权、IRQ 未屏蔽的 Thread 执行者中。外部串行化由调用方负责， 不建立 OS 锁、task、queue 或隐藏自动 rearm。deadline 是当前 Core 单调时间域的 有限绝对值；重启时间域后不能复用旧 deadline。ADON 后的 warmup 包含微秒取整 裕量。IRQ 锁存 ADC／DMA 事实并关闭已完成的发布源，只在所选终端条件成立后 门控采样；任务推进 service 承担完整排空和最终发布。"
msgstr "One privileged Thread executor with interrupts unmasked serializes calls. The caller provides serialization; there are no OS locks, tasks, queues or hidden automatic rearming. Deadlines are finite absolute values in the current Core monotonic domain; a restarted domain invalidates old deadlines. ADON warmup includes microsecond quantization margin. IRQs latch ADC/DMA facts and mask completed publishers, gating sampling only when the selected terminal conditions hold. Task-driven service performs complete drain and final publication."

msgid "循环 blocks 与规则／注入共用 owner"
msgstr "Circular blocks and a shared regular/injected owner"

msgid "`regular-blocks` 不提供有限 `submit`。调用者通过同一个 `nx_adc_group_port_t` 的 `start_blocks` 提供至少三个相等、FREE 且完整落在 DMA 域内的 slot。普通有限实例 不保留 stream、producer token 或 observer；可选 blocks state 仍是 168 B 的实测 ARM 布局。SUCCESS 表示接纳会话，warmup 后仍需显式 service 才开始采样。"
msgstr "`regular-blocks` does not provide finite `submit`. Through `start_blocks` on the same `nx_adc_group_port_t`, the caller supplies at least three equal-sized FREE slots wholly inside an authorized DMA domain. Ordinary finite instances contain no stream, producer tokens or observer. The optional blocks state retains its measured 168 B ARM layout. SUCCESS accepts the session; explicit service is still required after warmup to start sampling."

msgid "两个 DMA bank 与下一次替代 slot 共用现有 posted producer。先验证 CT／TC，替换 非活动 bank 的地址并回读，再发布旧 bank；不会把消费者持有的旧数据覆盖。没有 足够 FREE slot 时停止转换、完成排空，再等待归还；恢复经过 MULTI=0，产生新的 不连续边界，不保证暂停期间不丢样。stop 不能撤销已发布 consumer loan；归还后 才能完成 stream／observer 的 join。observer 使用已有调用者记录，只提供软件 完成观察时间与 epoch，不能解释为精确采样孔径或硬件触发计数。"
msgstr "Two DMA banks and the next replacement slot use the existing posted producer. The provider checks CT/TC, replaces and reads back the inactive bank address, then publishes the old bank. It never overwrites data held by a consumer. If too few FREE slots remain, it stops conversion, completes drain and waits for returned storage. Resume passes through MULTI=0 and creates a discontinuity; samples can be lost during the pause. Stop cannot revoke an already published consumer loan. Returned loans are required before stream/observer join can finish. An observer uses existing caller-owned records and supplies only software completion-observation times and epochs, not precise sampling apertures or hardware trigger counts."

msgid "交错 blocks 保持有限模式的原生 CDR 几何：三 ADC 的完整 frame 为六个结果，低／高 lane 的循环为 `1,2 / 3,1 / 2,3`。12／10 位每次 DMA word，8／6 位每次 halfword； 所有参与 ADC 都置 CONT，从 ADC1 软件启动，没有 timer 资源。RM0090 Rev22 §13.9.3 pp409–410 的 DELAY 是最小转换间隔，sampling 冲突会使间隔更长，因此 `physical_scan_halfcycles=0`，不承诺均匀 aperture。"
msgstr "Interleaved blocks retain the finite modes' native CDR geometry. A complete triple-ADC frame contains six results, with the low/high-lane cycle `1,2 / 3,1 / 2,3`. DMA accesses are words at 12/10 bits and halfwords at 8/6 bits. All participating ADCs set CONT and start in software from ADC1; no timer resource is used. DELAY in RM0090 Rev22 §13.9.3 pp409–410 is a minimum conversion interval. Sampling conflicts can lengthen it, so `physical_scan_halfcycles=0` and uniform sampling apertures are not promised."

msgid "`max_service_gap_us` 是调用者必须满足的上界。交错准入用各 ADC 的最快转换吞吐 上界，不用 DELAY 假造固定周期。若一个 bank 有 N 个原生样本、k 个 ADC、S 个采样 时钟、分辨率对应的 C 个转换时钟、f 个 ADCCLK／s、G 微秒服务间隔，则要求 `(N-B)*(S+C)*1000000 > (2*G+2)*k*f` 且 `N>B`。 B 保守预留每个 DR 与进行中的转换、四 word DMA FIFO 及两个 SINGLE AHB 在途 word，即 `B=2*k+24/storage_bytes`。`storage_bytes` 是每个原生样本的内存容器字节数： 12／10 位为 2，8／6 位为 1；依据 RM0090 §10.3.6、§10.3.18。FIFO 直接模式 也不能按无缓冲处理。预算不足直接拒绝，不分配更大的 buffer；时间预算丢失时 不发布无法证明的 bank。"
msgstr "`max_service_gap_us` is an upper bound the caller must meet. Interleaved admission uses an upper bound on each ADC's fastest conversion throughput, not an assumed fixed DELAY period. For a bank of N native samples, k ADCs, S sampling clocks, C conversion clocks for the selected resolution, f ADCCLK/s and a service interval G in microseconds, admission requires `(N-B)*(S+C)*1000000 > (2*G+2)*k*f` and `N>B`. B conservatively reserves each DR and ongoing conversion, the four-word DMA FIFO and two in-flight SINGLE AHB words: `B=2*k+24/storage_bytes`. Here `storage_bytes` is the memory-container size of one native sample in bytes: 2 at 12/10 bits, 1 at 8/6 bits, using RM0090 §10.3.6 and §10.3.18. Direct FIFO mode cannot be treated as unbuffered. Insufficient budget is rejected without allocating a larger buffer. A lost time budget never publishes an unproved bank."

msgid "两个 `regular-*-injected-blocks` 模式仅允许同步 dual／triple，不能与交错混用。 regular 与 injected 的 ranks／采样时间在 ADC 关闭时一起安装；它们不是两个 ADC owner。`submit_injected` 接受一个按 `injected_info` 布局准备的 raw request。 软件模式发出一次 JSWSTART；timer 模式独占另一条 Table 69 timer，先 UG、后 JEXTEN，最后提交 one-pulse。规则与注入 timer 的真实 APB 时钟分别解析，不互相 覆盖；TIM2、EXTI15 以及同一 timer bank 的双重使用都拒绝。"
msgstr "Both `regular-*-injected-blocks` modes allow only simultaneous dual/triple operation and cannot be combined with interleaving. Regular and injected ranks and sampling times are installed together while the ADCs are disabled; they do not have separate ADC owners. `submit_injected` accepts a raw request prepared in the layout returned by `injected_info`. Software mode emits one JSWSTART. Timer mode exclusively owns another Table 69 timer, issuing UG before JEXTEN and committing the one-pulse last. Regular and injected timer clocks are resolved independently from their actual APB domains; neither overwrites the other. TIM2, EXTI15 and reuse of the same timer bank for both roles are rejected."

msgid "`injected.min_interval_us` 连同 regular、injected 和被抢占的一个 regular conversion 共同约束转换预算。取消注入后仍等待所有 JEOC，或停止并 join 整个 controller； 失败不能只释放注入缓冲而保留仍可能访问它的 regular／IRQ owner。数值恢复时钟 不能修补已丢失的硬件 epoch。"
msgstr "`injected.min_interval_us` constrains the conversion budget together with regular conversion, injected conversion and one interrupted regular conversion. Cancellation still waits for every JEOC, or stops and joins the entire controller. Failure cannot release only the injected buffer while retaining a regular/IRQ owner that may still access it. Restoring a numerical clock value cannot repair lost hardware-epoch history."

msgid "有限 JAUTO 双结果"
msgstr "Finite paired JAUTO results"

msgid "`regular-auto-injected` 只支持一次同步 dual／triple regular→injected acquisition。 TOML 的 `injected` 只包含 `channels`／`sample_times`，不接纳独立 trigger、 `min_interval_us` 或循环 service-gap。软件在 ADON 关闭时配置 MULTI、两个序列及 JAUTO；JEXTEN／CONT／discontinuous 保持关闭。开始新请求前，实际读回 ADC_SR 写零已清除旧状态，旧 JEOC 不能满足新请求。依据 RM0090 §13.3.9 p396、 §13.9.1／§13.9.5，以及 ADC_SR 的 rc_w0 定义。"
msgstr "`regular-auto-injected` supports only one simultaneous dual/triple regular→injected acquisition. The TOML `injected` record contains only `channels` and `sample_times`; it accepts no independent trigger, `min_interval_us` or circular service-gap setting. Software configures MULTI, both sequences and JAUTO while ADON is off; JEXTEN, CONT and discontinuous modes remain disabled. Before a new request starts, actual ADC_SR readback proves that the write-zero operation cleared old status; old JEOC cannot satisfy the new request. This follows RM0090 §13.3.9 p396, §13.9.1/§13.9.5 and the rc_w0 definition of ADC_SR."

msgid "调用者用 `nx_adc_group_prepare_results` 准备一个具名的 `nx_adc_group_results_t`，其中 regular／injected 各含 data 与 bytes，随后通过同一 `submit` 提交。两个 `info` 返回各自的整数布局；injected 的 trigger 为 EVENT， 表示 regular 序列结束引发的 JAUTO，不表示另一条独立 timer。descriptor、request 和两个 span 必须互不重叠，也不能覆盖 System、provider 或静态事实。原 raw prepare 会设置 RAW discriminant；不具备 paired 能力的 provider 明确拒绝 paired request，不根据运行态重新解释内存。"
msgstr "The caller uses `nx_adc_group_prepare_results` to prepare one named `nx_adc_group_results_t`, with data and bytes for each regular/injected result, then submits it through the same `submit`. The two `info` queries return their separate integer layouts. The injected trigger is EVENT: JAUTO caused by the regular sequence ending, not another independent timer. The descriptor, request and both spans must be mutually disjoint and must not overlap System, provider state or static facts. Ordinary raw preparation sets the RAW discriminant. Providers without paired capability explicitly reject paired requests rather than reinterpreting memory according to runtime state."

msgid "DMA TC 只证明 regular 存储完成，不能提前关闭仍在转换的 injected ADC；所有 JEOC 也不能代替 DMA 退出。只有 TC 与全部 JEOC 都成立，且 source／ADC／DMA／ IRQ／地址联合退出后，才能读取 JDR 并共同发布一个成功 frame。任意错误保证零个 有效联合 frame；取消、超时或拒绝排空持续借用 descriptor 和两个完整 span。 当前实测 ARM request 和共享 ops 均维持 40 B，只有所选 JAUTO 实例保留 64 B state。 这些是结构和软件证据，不是模拟吞吐或电气资格。"
msgstr "DMA TC proves only that regular storage is complete; it cannot disable an injected ADC that is still converting. All JEOC flags also cannot replace DMA withdrawal. Only after TC and every JEOC are established and the source, ADCs, DMA, IRQs and addresses are jointly withdrawn may the provider read JDR and publish one successful joint frame. Every error guarantees zero valid joint frames. Cancellation, timeout or refused drain retains the descriptor and both complete spans. Measured ARM request and shared ops layouts remain 40 B each; only a selected JAUTO instance retains the 64 B state. These are structural and software results, not analog-throughput or electrical qualification."

msgid "借用、故障和关闭"
msgstr "Borrowing, faults and close"

msgid "拒绝不取得 request 或输出借用。接受后，request 与整个输出由 provider 独占至 acquire 观察到 SETTLED。取消或超时只确定终止原因，不撤销借用。成功恰好报告请求 的完整 frame 数；错误报告零个有效 frame，不能把 DMA 前缀当作成功数据。"
msgstr "Rejection borrows neither request nor output. Acceptance exclusively borrows the request and complete output until SETTLED is observed with acquire ordering. Cancellation and timeout select a terminal reason without revoking borrowing. Success reports exactly the requested complete frames; an error reports zero valid frames. A DMA prefix cannot be published as successful data."

msgid "submit 返回 SUCCESS 只表示接纳请求。接纳后，prime 的有限 warmup 无法表示时， 同一 request 转入排空，service 在实际退出后以 EXHAUSTED 和零进度结清；不返回 虚假的无借用拒绝。有限排空预算无法表示时保持立即到期，不改成 NEVER；先尝试 真实硬件退出，仍不能退出才保留 QUARANTINED、request 和完整缓冲供同一 owner 重试。"
msgstr "SUCCESS from submit means request acceptance. If finite warmup becomes unrepresentable during prime after acceptance, the same request enters drain. After actual withdrawal, service settles it with EXHAUSTED and zero progress instead of reporting a false rejection without a borrow. An unrepresentable finite drain budget remains immediately expired rather than becoming NEVER. Attempt actual hardware withdrawal first; if it still fails, retain QUARANTINED, the request and the whole buffer for the same owner to retry."


msgid "排空依次停止触发与转换、撤 DMA 请求、禁用并回读 DMA EN、稳定 NDTR、清除实际 硬件地址、join ADC／DMA IRQ，然后把 MULTI 撤回 independent。最终 ADC 错误和 DMA 错误仍参与结果判定；最后一次观察不能因进入清理而被忽略。没有可信完成时间戳 时，完成首次在 deadline 之后被观察仍返回 TIMEOUT。"
msgstr "Drain stops triggers and conversion, withdraws DMA requests, disables and reads back DMA EN, stabilizes NDTR, clears actual hardware addresses, joins ADC/DMA IRQs and restores MULTI to independent mode. Final ADC and DMA errors still determine the result; cleanup cannot discard the final observation. Without a trusted completion timestamp, completion first observed after the deadline remains TIMEOUT."

msgid "无法停止、清除地址或 join IRQ 时保留 QUARANTINED、缓冲与配置。调用者可以在原 实例上重试 stop／service；不得改写或回收缓冲。普通 stop 排空当前请求并清除可恢复 故障，保留静态资源供下一次请求；Platform close 则封闭准入，恢复公共配置并归还 时钟、DMA 和引脚。关闭失败不能再次开放采样，也不能换配置继续清理。"
msgstr "Failed stop, address clearing or IRQ join retains QUARANTINED storage, buffers and configuration. The caller may retry stop/service on that same instance but cannot modify or reclaim buffers. Ordinary stop drains the current request and clears a recoverable fault while retaining static resources for reuse. Platform close seals admission, restores common configuration and returns clocks, DMA and pads. Failed close neither reopens acquisition nor permits rebinding configuration for cleanup."

msgid "软件参考与边界"
msgstr "Software references and limits"

msgid "完整软件装配位于 `tests/contracts/adc_group_assembly/`，涵盖 VE／ZG、双／三 ADC、 同步／交错／注入和裸机／FreeRTOS。它们声明测试用片内路线，不能代替真实 PCB 原理图。GoogleTest 执行真实 provider 与生成 factory 路径；ARM ELF 检查所选编译、 链接与资源；Source SDK 检查外部消费闭包。各类证据独立记录，不继承旧计数。"
msgstr "Complete software assemblies in `tests/contracts/adc_group_assembly/` cover VE/ZG, dual/triple ADC, simultaneous/interleaved/injected operation and bare metal/FreeRTOS. Their test-only internal routes do not replace a real PCB schematic. GoogleTest executes the actual provider and generated factories; ARM ELFs check selected compilation, linking and resources; Source SDK checks external consumption closure. Each evidence scope is recorded separately without inherited counts."

msgid "当前不提供连续 JAUTO 的逐次 JDR 结果保证、交错与注入并行、运行期换 sequence、 未建模的外部 trigger owner、内部通道多 ADC 或模拟工程量换算。上述 timer 注入 不代表接纳任意外部事件；有限 paired JAUTO 不代表连续自动采集。所列模式不承诺 实测同步偏差、吞吐、IRQ 延迟、模拟精度或物理看门狗响应；实板为 `not_executed`。"
msgstr "The current implementation provides no per-result JDR guarantee for continuous JAUTO, no concurrent interleaved/injected operation, runtime sequence replacement, unmodeled external trigger owners, multiple-ADC internal channels or engineering-unit conversion. The timer-injected modes above do not admit arbitrary external events, and finite paired JAUTO does not establish continuous automatic acquisition. Listed modes do not promise measured synchronization error, throughput, IRQ latency, analog accuracy or physical watchdog response. Hardware execution remains `not_executed`."
